cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use pubTreeServer, cite the official software website; please check
  the project homepage for an updated software publication citation.
type: software
title: 'pubTreeServer: An All-in-One Web Platform from Genomic Sequences to Publication-Ready, Annotated Phylogenomic Trees'
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Xiangyang
url: 'https://mgs.microbialgenomic.cn/pubTreeServer'
abstract: >-
  pubTreeServer integrates pubAutoTree for automated phylogenomic inference
  with TreeVisualizer for interactive phylogenetic tree visualization,
  14 annotation types and publication-ready figure export.
